Subject: [PATCH 06895/11362] [outer-loop] r11l: L6 SOLVED, FULL GAME CLEAR
 (round 6, gpt-5.6-sol)

Round-6 codex gpt-5.6-sol session executed r11l's round-5 route (fuse
9+15+14 on the three-handle carrier into the upper-right socket, fuse
6+11+10 on the two-handle carrier into the lower-left socket) and won
on tail click 59, one action before the hard 60-action cutoff.

The source agent's own reproduction_verified is honestly false (a
shortened gate attempt omitted a required {"action":0} reset boundary
between the L5 prefix and the clean L6 route, and failed). The outer
loop independently verified the full 305-action live-observed
trajectory instead: added a new >=6 priority branch to
resolve_replay_plan() pointing at
results/outer_loop_fable5_r11l_probe.json, then ran 5x fresh
env.reset() + replay. All 5 trials confirmed level=6,
state=GameState.WIN.

ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml: r11l levels_reproduced 5 -> 6,
full_game_clear: true, final_game_state: GameState.WIN, dated gotcha
entry documenting the reset-boundary discovery. reproducible_total_levels
157 -> 158 (sum-checked against per-game entries; arc_count_integrity_lint
exit 0).

